Sample ID: integer between 1 and 99999
DNA Concentration: float between 0.1 and 1000.0
Protein Concentration: float between 0.01 and 500.0
Sequence Quality Score: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Colony Count: integer between 0 and 1000
PCR Primers: Forward Primer 1, Reverse Primer 1, Forward Primer 2, Reverse Primer 2, Universal Primers
Gel Type: Agarose, Polyacrylamide, Pulse-Field, Denaturing
Vector Type: Plasmid, Cosmid, BAC, YAC, Viral Vector
Antibody Type: Primary Antibody, Secondary Antibody, Monoclonal, Polyclonal
